{"module":"/assets/explain/knowledge/reciprocal-sum-function.js","part":"figure","scope":"reciprocal-sum-function","title":"拖动区间：最低点在不在区间里，最大值在哪一端","note":"默认是 $x+\\frac4x$ 在 $[1,3]$ 上。左右拖动区间、切换 $k$：最低点 $x=\\sqrt k$ 落在区间里时最小值是 $2\\sqrt k$，否则最小值在端点；最大值总在端点，看两端点之积比 $k$ 大还是小。$y$ 轴上的粗线就是值域。","after":"bounds","stylesheet":"/assets/explain/knowledge/reciprocal-sum-function.css","version":"bca91c85e80e","html":"<div class=\"rs-explorer\">\n      <div class=\"rs-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"k 的值\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-rs-k=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">k = 1</button><button type=\"button\" data-rs-k=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\">k = 2</button><button type=\"button\" data-rs-k=\"4\" aria-pressed=\"true\">k = 4</button>\n      </div>\n      <svg class=\"rs-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 230\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"rs-graph-title\">\n    <title id=\"rs-graph-title\">函数 y = x + k/x 的图像，可以左右拖动一段区间</title>\n    <defs><clipPath id=\"rs-clip\"><rect x=\"24\" y=\"12\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\"/></clipPath></defs>\n    <rect x=\"24\" y=\"12\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" rx=\"6\" class=\"rs-plot\"/>\n    <path d=\"M24 117.88235294117648H344M161.14285714285714 12V212\" class=\"rs-axis\"/>\n    <path d=\"M-82.66666666666666 212L344 47.29411764705884\" clip-path=\"url(#rs-clip)\" class=\"rs-asymptote\"/>\n    <text x=\"331.8095238095238\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"rs-asymptote-label\">y = x</text>\n    <text x=\"191.61904761904762\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"rs-tick\">1</text><text x=\"222.0952380952381\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"rs-tick\">2</text><text x=\"252.57142857142858\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"rs-tick\">3</text><text x=\"283.04761904761904\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"rs-tick\">4</text><text x=\"313.5238095238095\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"rs-tick\">5</text>\n    <text x=\"161.14285714285714\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"rs-tick\">0</text>\n    <g data-rs-layer></g>\n  </svg>\n      <input class=\"rs-slider\" type=\"range\" data-rs-slider min=\"0.5\" max=\"3.5\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"1\" aria-label=\"区间的位置\">\n      <div class=\"rs-status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <p class=\"rs-row\"><span class=\"rs-tag interval\">区间</span><b data-rs-interval></b></p>\n        <p class=\"rs-row\"><span class=\"rs-tag low\">最小值</span><b data-rs-at=\"low\"></b><small data-rs-why=\"low\"></small></p>\n        <p class=\"rs-row\"><span class=\"rs-tag high\">最大值</span><b data-rs-at=\"high\"></b><small data-rs-why=\"high\"></small></p>\n        <p class=\"rs-row\"><span class=\"rs-tag range\">值域</span><b data-rs-range></b><small>最小值到最大值之间的数都取得到，所以值域是闭区间。</small></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>"}
